Text: Widyantoro et. used content features, qualifying adjectives and meta-discourse features [15] to explore AZ task. It took eﬀorts to engineer these features and it is also time consuming to optimize the combination of the entire features. With the advent of neural networks [16], it is possible for computers to learn feature representations automatically. Recently, word embedding technique [17] has been widely used in the NLP community.

