Text: Those features are input into the classiﬁers for supervised classiﬁcation. Using 10-cross-validation scheme, evaluation was conducted on the Argumentative-Zoning (AZ) annotated articles. The results showed that simply averaging the word vectors in a sentence works better than the paragraph to vector algo- rithm and by integrating speciﬁc cuewords into the loss function of the neural network can improve the classiﬁcation performance.

